* MC of a tetrapeptide
* based on charmm mc testcase
* Dec 2020, SB, adapt for charmm course
*

! this script just sets up psf and starting coordinates; base
! for the actual MC tests

! Read topology and parameter files
stream toppar.str

READ SEQUENCE CARD
* RGDS
*
4
ARG GLY ASP SER
GENERATE MAIN FIRST NTER LAST CTER SETUP

OPEN writ CARD UNIT 21 NAME data/rgds.psf
writ psf card UNIT 21
* psf of test peptide for visualization
*

IC PARAM
IC SEED MAIN 2 N MAIN 2 CA MAIN 2 C
IC BUILD

OPEN writ CARD UNIT 21 NAME data/rgds_start.crd
writ coor card UNIT 21
* initial coors of test peptide
*

OPEN writ CARD UNIT 21 NAME data/rgds_start.pdb
writ coor pdb UNIT 21
* initial coors of test peptide
*

! Infinite cutoff for testing

NBONDS  ATOM  switch CDIE  VDW VSwitch  -
        CUTNB 200.0 CTOFNB 18.0 CTONNB 16.0  WMIN 1.5  EPS 1.0

ENERgy

stop
